      "text": "This is where we find out what really happened to Bucky after the drone plane exploded. Gripping stuff. Bucky has become the Winter Soldier, and is a pawn of the Russian Government. An assassin. Steve Rogers learns this as we do from a top secret file folder mysteriously left in his studio apartment. Steve has another WWII flashback then buries his head in his hands in grief. He knows."
